# Scratch harnesses, not part of the toolkit. A round that reads the
# photographs writes a handful of throwaway contact-sheet scripts; what is
# worth keeping from them is the READING, which goes into the catalogue
# comments and ASK-PERETZ.md. The root pattern is here because the last round's
# five landed there and sat in `git status` for a week.
tools/_*.mjs
/_*.mjs

# Contact sheets: 17 MB, and every one is a pure function of the photographs
# plus `npm run triage`. What is worth keeping from that pass is the READING
# of them (research/works/INVENTORY.md) and the descriptors they were ordered
# by (research/works/auto/), and both of those are committed.
screenshots/sheet-*.png
